  "releaseNotes": "API Updates:\n* Refresh the Bing Ads API Version 13 Campaign Management, Customer Management, and Reporting service proxies.\n* Add Objective Based campaign support and related campaign fields.\n* Add AssetGroupId keyword support with optional AdGroupId requests and the GetKeywordsByAssetGroupId operation.\n* Add the GetLinkedInSegments and GetCompanyListDetails operations.\n* Add UnifiedCampaignFields while preserving the existing PageFeedInAISearchSettings flag value.\n* Add RON currency support in Customer Management.\n* Add the HeadlineSource report column in Reporting.\n\nBulk API Updates:\n* Add CompanyList, CompanyItem, AdGroupUrlTargets, and AdGroupAIPromptAssociations download selectors.\n* Add BulkAdGroupAIPromptAssociation and align BulkAdGroupUrlTarget with its supported fields.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
